 something unique about the animal while being practical for everyday use.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Should I choose a name based on my alligator snapping turtle's appearance?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Absolutely! alligator snapping turtle's distinctive features make wonderful naming inspiration. Names based on color, size, or markings create an immediate connection and help others appreciate your pet's unique beauty.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Can I use a human name for my alligator snapping turtle?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Human names are very popular for pets! Names like Charlie, Max, Luna, and Bella work wonderfully and can make your bond with your alligator snapping turtle feel even more personal and meaningful.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"How many names should I consider before choosing?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"We recommend shortlisting 3-5 favorite names, then testing them over a few days. Say each name aloud during different activities — the one that consistently feels natural is your winner.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Do alligator snapping turtles respond better to certain sounds?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Animals tend to respond best to names ending in a vowel sound, especially 'ee' sounds like Charlie or Lucy. Names with hard consonants at the beginning (like K, T, B) also capture attention more effectively.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-8\",\"children\":[\"📖 \",\"Alligator Snapping Turtle\",\" Naming Guide\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\",\"children\":[\"0\",1]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Spend time observing your alligator snapping turtle's behavior before finalizing a name — the right name often reveals itself through personality.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\",\"children\":[\"0\",2]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Choose a name that is easy to pronounce and won't embarrass you when calling it in public.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\",\"children\":[\"0\",3]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Consider names with two syllables — they are short enough for quick recognition but distinct enough to avoid confusion.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-3 text-gray-7